translate es qst_DamzelDizzt_3_ruckus_TarekDead_f3626d5e:

    # "Gently I moved forward and grabbed Nijah's arm, she screamed in horror before I reiterated it was me."
    "Con cuidado avancé y agarré el brazo de Nijah, que gritó horrorizada antes de que le reiterara que era yo."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_3.rpy:128
